  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child Rights Protection &amp; Promotion, A Life Free from Violence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will promote child rights, creating an environment free from violence in 4 districts. Through selected partners, civil society networks and government stakeholders will be strengthened and create a social fundament for advocacy and communication between local and national levels. This serves advocacy for child rights, case handling, and enforcing legislation. Children&#x2019;s advocacy in preventing violations along with creation of a joint platform to support children is a proven strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
